 Existing actual company CLI executes MarriottB10/B11 from the same source-only package after this program change, produces CSV/evidence and keeps exact99aa23.../ae7ab4... Result IDs and FY2025. Original program/configuration changes are visible in its new ordinary version; prior records remain. Per-record actual timings are saved in `company-after-light-entry.json`; this run does not prove total calculation latency improved. One observed B10 preparation14.338s/check2.583s is not concealed or compared as the same baseline as earlier case/API timing.
 
 72 affected tests pass28.574s; exact dedicated CI's97 test command passes53.013s. Initial receive stopped after discovering its new test file did not exist in receiver; the associated test loader failure is retained, then the necessary test file was added and consumers switched. No passed result is attributed to that incomplete command. The source quote checker is now portable from repository evidence plus explicit `--source-root`; all three original numeric/context/unit checks reproduced. Actual source ledger195claims and SHA6023bf...6eb remains unchanged.
 
 PR60R1 dedicated37544113496 SUCCESS but its broad37544113468 FAILURE; final PR67 head remains independently tracked. This is current program/company integration, no new complete-company content acceptance or paid/SEC call.
+
+### B03 current input scope and rule roots (2026-10-07)
+
+The current company branch explicitly passes program rules and requests the bounded depreciation input check. Default omitted source APIs remain legacy-compatible; no historical Spec or Run is signed again. The copied ordinary_da_scope_v1 is byte-identical to #47d7d5938's historical_da_scope_candidate. Adapter differences are mechanical CIK/scheme/namespace/period/USD binding, current Spec re-evaluation after at most one proven retake, and existing #28 narrow/impairment/contract-revenue checks. No new English classifier, no preference for larger amounts and no policy amendment. NO_DIRECT_CANDIDATE still needs the approved composition and original component support.
+
+Actual company run/source-only originals: MarriottFY2025B03=0.1756281982738868097456656229 ratio (17.5628%) from4.141bn operating income plus145m depreciation and313m intangible amortization over26.186bn revenue.135m contract investment amortization is an explicit fee-revenue deduction, including its FeeServiceMember context and gross/deduction/net table relationship; it is excluded, not added. Runtime2.787s. This accepts the already-given owner's bounded treatment, not a general EBITDA business audit.
+
+SalesforceFY2026 now has a named WITHHELD result, B03_DEPRECIATION_AMORTIZATION_SCOPE_UNPROVEN:1.2bn fixed-asset subset conflicts with3.631bn statement amount; the latter may include impairment and is not substituted. B01revenue41.525bn remains. Runtime3.189s; one pre-existing unrelated failed eventheader remains visible. Sidecar input-assessments.json (6.4KB/5.9KB) preserves actual source comparisons/exclusions and links input/result/period for ordinary independent reading. Damage and coordinate checks remain; no re-calculation for that read. The null result's ID happens to match #47's intrinsic null Result identity; this own company execution/source/state, not shared acceptance credit.
+
+Two confirmed wrong identities are precisely withdrawn in the existing #28 register: current normal API f07e137... and archived index e13a5d8... .The finite check also inspected current output evidence selecting the1.2bn fact for the same accession/period. Old publication files,Run,wrong ratio and historical fiscal label are untouched; no all-history scan claim, no metric-name-wide withdrawal, no all390 progress inflation. Current statistics/readers consume this register.
+
+Amendment and instant-balance source inputs accept optional program rules; current CompanyFacts/zero-AI callers propagate them. Ordinary income preparation now uses the same original financial-source helper from normal_governance_input, not the unrelated normal_candidates Run/controller import; the legacyB06 alias and source packet shape remain. Actual amended/successor root validation is still a separate remaining check, not established by Marriott's empty amendment positive.
+
+9finite source/precision/retake/entity/period/currency/namespace/context-scheme/source-only/persistence checks pass8.563s.116 affected tests pass70.275s, including default fiscal resolver and old Calculator/Spec tests. Initial failures were wrong test assumptions about the reader's return fields, then the135m fact's dimensions; logs retained and assertions corrected to actual disk API and FeeServiceMember, not by dropping scope. macOS source path test now resolves its expected alias; actual alias test passes14.136s. New numeric/semantic adaptation remains pending limited independent review. No project business calls; old budget and source ledger unchanged.
